  "post_title": "Versos (i besos) d'Albert Bellés il·lustrats per Irene Garcia Molina al Març de la Dona d'Onda",
  "post_date": "2016-03-19 10:35:05",
  "post_name": "versos-i-besos-dalbert-belles-il%c2%b7lustrats-per-irene-garcia-molina-al-marc-de-la-dona-donda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>(48 fotos) Fins divendres 1 d&#39;abril es pot visitar a la Casa de la Cultura d&#39;Onda l&#39;exposici&oacute; Be(r)sos il&middot;lustrats.Dones, amb poemes del poeta d&#39;Onda Abic Bic (Albert Bell&eacute;s i Chorva) i il&middot;lustracions de Lluna Llunera (Irene Carcia Molina), tamb&eacute; ondera.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_4051.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;horari &eacute;s, de dilluns a dissabte (excepte festius), de les 11.00 h a les 13.30 hores i de les 17.30 h a les 20.30 h. Diumenges i festius, est&agrave; oberta de les 11.00 h a les 14.00 hores. La mostra est&agrave; dins dels actes del Mar&ccedil; de la Dona, organitzats per l&#39;Ajuntament.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_4069.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En una inauguraci&oacute; molt concorreguda, despr&eacute;s de la introducci&oacute; a c&agrave;rrec del regidor d&#39;Igualtat, Asensio Blaya Mart&iacute;nez, han intervingut Irene i albert per a explicar l&#39;objectiu de l&#39;exposici&oacute;. Quatre dones i dos homes han llegit poemes, l&#39;&uacute;ltim l&#39;alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, que ha tancat l&#39;acte.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_4118.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Entre el nombr&oacute;s p&uacute;blic assistent estava tamb&eacute; l&#39;actor d&#39;Onda V&iacute;ctor Palmer Guerola, a punt d&#39;estrenar nova temporada de la s&egrave;rie <em>La que se avecina</em> de <em>Telecinco</em>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4051.jpg\" alt=\"img_4051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4052.jpg\" alt=\"img_4052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4054.jpg\" alt=\"img_4054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4055.jpg\" alt=\"img_4055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4056.jpg\" alt=\"img_4056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4057.jpg\" alt=\"img_4057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4058.jpg\" alt=\"img_4058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4061.jpg\" alt=\"img_4061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4064.jpg\" alt=\"img_4064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4065.jpg\" alt=\"img_4065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4066.jpg\" alt=\"img_4066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4067.jpg\" alt=\"img_4067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4069.jpg\" alt=\"img_4069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneraabicbic/img_4075.jpg\" alt=\"img_4075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\"